                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “And you shall make the robe of the ephod all of blue. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It shall have in it an opening for the head, with a woven binding around the opening, like the opening in a garment,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28.32",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "The Hebrew word is of uncertain meaning",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " that it may not be torn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On its skirts you shall make pomegranates of blue and purple and scarlet stuff, around its skirts, with bells of gold between them, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a golden bell and a pomegranate, a golden bell and a pomegranate, round about on the skirts of the robe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And it shall be upon Aaron when he ministers, and its sound shall be heard when he goes into the holy place before the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", and when he comes out, lest he die.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
